      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i have a massive toothache like i cant even sleep and its driving me crazy. i have some tylenol but its not really doing anything. if i take like 3 or 4 of the extra strength ones at once will that help more so i can finally pass out? or is that too much? i really need it to work tonight.",
